OL,3,GNEWSA#350k contract approved for
OL,4,Aviaduct wall repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA contract worth an estimated #350,000
OL,7,Fis set to be awarded to reconstruct the
OL,8,Fretaining wall at Knaresborough's
OL,9,FViaduct Terrace.
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire Council approved the
OL,12,Fdirect award of the contract as it
OL,13,Fmoves forward with plans for a
OL,14,Fpermanent solution at the high-profile
OL,15,Friverside location.
OL,17,FThe decision follows its collapse in
OL,18,FFebruary, which led to the popular area
OL,19,Fbeneath being closed off for safety
OL,20,Freasons. Local residents had asked for
OL,21,Frepairs to be carried out urgently
OL,22,Fbefore winter weather sets in.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
